WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.440
The president will not find lawlessness or violence here.

00:04.440 --> 00:06.940
I've been so deeply disappointed to see footage

00:06.940 --> 00:11.240
from a half decade ago, recycled and recycled again.

00:11.240 --> 00:14.080
If President Trump came to Portland today,

00:14.080 --> 00:17.380
what he would find are people riding their bikes,

00:17.380 --> 00:20.580
playing sports, enjoying the sunshine,

00:20.580 --> 00:23.120
buying produce at a farmer's market.

00:23.120 --> 00:25.060
People enjoy sunshine and buy produce

00:25.060 --> 00:26.600
at farmer's markets in Ukraine.

00:26.600 --> 00:30.540
Is Ukraine a-okay and recycled footage?

00:30.540 --> 00:33.400
There's been riots for over a hundred days.

00:33.400 --> 00:36.980
They showed footage of January 6th for two years,

00:36.980 --> 00:38.680
and that was only one day.

